| 🔑 **KV coverage** | **{{ cov.kv }}/{{ total }} ({{ cov_kv_pct }}%)** |

!!! note "Why coverage is not 100%"
    The new tags (`platform/topology/network_type/ip_stack`) and KV (`node_count`, …)
    are injected from `cluster_info` **after a successful install**. Failed/errored jobs
    and green-run (`kvr-green`) jobs on existing clusters legitimately have no coverage.

